{"product_id":"song-of-the-shiver-barrens-the-mirage-makers-book-three","title":"Song of the Shiver Barrens the Mirage Makers Book Three","description":"\u003cp\u003eLigea's son, Arrant, leaves Tyrans for Kardiastan to take his place as Mirager-heir, while Ligea prepares to halt an insurrection. But Arrant's skills as a Magoroth are dangerously inconsistent, and his father, Temellin, finds it difficult to communicate with this secretive young man he barely knows. Arrant's singular ability to communicate with his half-brother, Tarran - a part of the collective mind known as the Mirage Makers - leads them both towards the possibility of a tragic clash with the encroaching Ravage. As Arrant's enemies among the Magoroth plot to ruin his family and his future as heir, he begins to realise there is a greater mystery to solve if he is to prevail. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:109 x 180  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Glenda Larke \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780732282004 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 512\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43616724156569,"sku":"12RB9780732282004","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/17946cda58d7dd2e4f7857a8bdff8577.jpg?v=1700724329","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/song-of-the-shiver-barrens-the-mirage-makers-book-three","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}